Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.37,0:00:33.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是哪位
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.00,0:00:40.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道本小姐乃常盤台中學的婚后光子嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.60,0:02:47.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真期待啊 學舍之園
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.24,0:02:49.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話是這麼說啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.72,0:02:53.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那裡不過只是些女子學校聚集的小鎮嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.59,0:02:57.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正是那些聚在一起的學校 才不普通啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.86,0:02:59.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,常盤台中學自然不用說
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.81,0:03:02.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他那些都是著名的大小姐學校哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.64,0:03:04.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話是這麼說沒錯啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.79,0:03:08.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是多虧了白井她們邀請 我們才能進去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.83,0:03:11.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然的話 像我這樣的平民
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.02,0:03:14.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概一輩子都是跟那裡無緣的了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.81,0:03:17.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也太卑躬屈膝了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.36,0:03:20.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再說 初春你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.72,0:03:22.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦 這是？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.85,0:03:25.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼嘛 佐天你不也一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.09,0:03:29.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天要去的那家蛋糕店 都做好功課了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.33,0:03:32.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因...因為 那可是Pasticceria Manicagni啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.18,0:03:36.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「嚴格挑選的用料和跟義大利本國分毫不差的配方
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.44,0:03:39.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,烤出來的起司蛋糕可謂是藝術品」上面不是這樣寫著嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.03,0:03:42.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這起司蛋糕我之前就想嘗一嘗了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.18,0:03:45.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是在日本 那家店只在學舍之園裡面開了分店啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.01,0:03:48.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐天啊 你原來還挺愛趕流行的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.40,0:03:54.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一站是學舍之園入口 學舍之園入口
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.50,0:04:02.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀 巴士比預計時間要早到呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.09,0:04:07.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用擔心 3 2 1
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.94,0:04:13.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 這個都市的天氣預報還是一如既往地神啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.79,0:04:15.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,與其說那是預報
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.16,0:04:20.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不如說是「宣讀由演算而確定的未來現象」更加貼切
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.31,0:04:25.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我覺得偶爾出現報不準的搞笑情況也挺好的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.94,0:04:28.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先不說這個了 我們快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.17,0:04:37.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們是受常盤台中學一年級的白井黑子邀請而來的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.21,0:04:38.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初春飾利和
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.60,0:04:39.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐天淚子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.10,0:04:43.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 你們可以進去了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.32,0:05:10.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這座小鎮實在太可愛了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.33,0:05:13.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斑馬線乃至紅綠燈
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.22,0:05:15.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全都跟外面的設計不一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.03,0:05:17.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,氣氛真夠濃厚啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.57,0:05:21.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的就像到了外國一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.11,0:05:23.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.42,0:05:31.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 我們好像很引人注目啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.39,0:05:35.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 注目的是我們這身打扮吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.37,0:05:39.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在這裡 肯定很少看到外面的學生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.23,0:05:41.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 原來是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.50,0:05:45.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕 時間已經到了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.20,0:05:47.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 真的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.49,0:05:49.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來 我們趕快吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.13,0:05:55.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她們倆動作真慢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.25,0:05:58.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,碰頭的地點是在這裡沒錯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.51,0:06:01.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯 是她們說想參觀一下我們學校
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.53,0:06:03.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都特地選在校門口會合了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.09,0:06:07.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 竟然讓姐姐大人等這麼久 她們啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.41,0:06:08.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 來了來了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.97,0:06:13.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.53,0:06:14.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 這個嘛...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.98,0:06:16.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不小心在水窪...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.60,0:06:18.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.62,0:06:28.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,急急忙忙說要換衣服 我們就只能準備這些了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.43,0:06:30.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪裡 有這些就夠了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.66,0:06:34.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尺寸怎樣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.04,0:06:36.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正合身呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.34,0:06:39.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是裙子太短了 下身涼颼颼的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.71,0:06:42.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就佐天有衣服換 太狡猾了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.60,0:06:47.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了！ 跟我換一換校服吧 就這麼決定了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.30,0:06:48.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.43,0:06:50.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你那尺寸太小了 我穿不了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.52,0:06:52.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我也去水窪那裡...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.53,0:06:53.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你別這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.89,0:06:55.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一下下就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.75,0:06:56.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 初春
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.80,0:07:01.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那身髒校服我已經拿去洗衣店了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.80,0:07:02.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回去的時候順便去取吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.50,0:07:07.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,覺得麻煩的話 我叫店家直接送到你們宿舍
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.07,0:07:09.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是常盤台
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.65,0:07:13.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是女僕嗎？ 果然是女僕幫洗衣服嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.33,0:07:14.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你冷靜點
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.35,0:07:21.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個叫草莓Crostata的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.35,0:07:21.14,Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(484,440)}<義式草莓醬批>
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.49,0:07:25.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊不不 叫Monte Bianco的看起來也挺好吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.49,0:07:25.67,Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(354,440)}<勃朗峰栗子蛋糕>
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.95,0:07:29.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 這個叫Cioccolata也難以捨棄
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.95,0:07:29.25,Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(414,440)}<巧克力>
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.30,0:07:31.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的有這麼值得煩惱嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.22,0:07:35.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘛 我之前已經決定好要吃起司蛋糕了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.31,0:07:38.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不快點的話 天就要黑囉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.60,0:07:41.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 請...請稍等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.21,0:07:45.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.80,0:07:47.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.77,0:07:51.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.35,0:07:53.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,緊急召集嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.49,0:07:53.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.37,0:07:57.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有比這個更糟的時機了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.77,0:08:01.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初春那一份 我幫忙外帶吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.15,0:08:03.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.09,0:08:06.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們走 初春
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.56,0:08:07.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.55,0:08:10.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真夠匆忙的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.95,0:08:12.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我們就...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.59,0:08:16.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個 我先去趟洗手間
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.78,0:08:25.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 難得到了個不用值班的星期六
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.99,0:08:26.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,痛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.06,0:08:27.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,痛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.31,0:08:30.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別剛到就發牢騷
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.66,0:08:32.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思 固法學姐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.91,0:08:35.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話說回來 為什麼叫我們回來
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.86,0:08:37.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天放學後到夜間這段時間
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.51,0:08:40.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有六名常盤台的學生
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.12,0:08:43.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,連續遭到了襲擊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.46,0:08:49.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且 全部發生在學舍之園裡面
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.71,0:09:03.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,常盤台的學生 全部都有Level 3以上的水準
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.63,0:09:08.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,盯上她們 還輕而易舉地擊倒了這點來看
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.42,0:09:10.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,犯人是有相當水平的能力者吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.22,0:09:13.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能性很高呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.37,0:09:16.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 能力還是未明
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.55,0:09:17.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有受害者都...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.16,0:09:28.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被電擊槍電暈
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.17,0:09:33.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後 那些失去意識的受害者們怎樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.21,0:09:35.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然有照片
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.79,0:09:38.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很慘哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.70,0:09:42.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要看的話 先做好覺悟
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.41,0:09:50.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紅茶都要涼了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.58,0:09:55.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然志願加入了風紀委員 我就已經做好了覺悟
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.44,0:09:57.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.07,0:09:59.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.08,0:10:01.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.91,0:10:09.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐天？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.76,0:10:13.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 喂喂
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.63,0:10:16.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐天
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.00,0:10:22.00,title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(382,10)}{\bord0}#3 被盯上 {\1c&H4D81DF}的常盤台
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.96,0:10:26.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,常盤台獵人？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.77,0:10:30.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來是這樣 因為她穿著我們的校服
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.08,0:10:32.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她的情況怎樣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.12,0:10:35.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,醫生說她身體沒什麼大礙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.59,0:10:38.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,躺一會兒應該就沒事了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.05,0:10:39.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.11,0:10:45.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,犯人有眉目了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.17,0:10:46.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.90,0:10:50.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看來是個挺難纏的能力者
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.13,0:10:51.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.85,0:10:54.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肉眼看不見
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.07,0:10:58.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.69,0:11:00.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我什麼都沒看到
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.82,0:11:03.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃 但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.94,0:11:05.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,監視攝影機的影像裡有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.05,0:11:09.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算裡面有 我也真的沒看到
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.03,0:11:14.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,受害者看不見的犯人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.90,0:11:18.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們最開始是懷疑光學操縱系的能力者
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.47,0:11:22.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是能完全隱藏自己身影的能力者
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.37,0:11:24.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,學院都市裡面有47人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.30,0:11:28.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是全部人都有不在場證據
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.65,0:11:31.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先別說不在場證據 監視攝影機不是拍到了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.98,0:11:35.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟那個叫光學操縱系的 有點不一樣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.34,0:11:36.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.01,0:11:38.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 鴿子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.15,0:11:39.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.91,0:11:41.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白井你沒看到嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.98,0:11:44.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是沒注意到
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.97,0:11:46.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,注意不到
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.48,0:11:49.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初春
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.55,0:11:50.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想請你幫忙調查一下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.91,0:11:55.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.86,0:11:57.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能力名叫「Dummy Check」
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.02,0:12:02.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是阻礙對方對「眼中的對象」認知的能力
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.85,0:12:04.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,符合這條件的能力者只有一個
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.21,0:12:07.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,關所中學 2年級
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.89,0:12:08.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重福省帆
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.43,0:12:10.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是她！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.03,0:12:13.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是她只是Level 2
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.03,0:12:13.41,Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(498,440)}<異能力者>
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.10,0:12:19.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,實驗資料說她沒有完全消除自己存在的能力
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.10,0:12:23.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唔...還以為沿這條線查下去會很順呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.46,0:12:31.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.52,0:12:32.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐天
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.41,0:12:34.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要勉強自...己
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.09,0:12:48.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這 這這這這這這這
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.99,0:12:51.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐天 你振作點
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.82,0:12:54.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這打擊夠狠的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.90,0:12:59.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有像她這麼長的瀏海的話 就能遮住了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.51,0:13:00.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瀏海？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.61,0:13:03.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是她
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.66,0:13:06.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看見犯人了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.93,0:13:07.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.50,0:13:09.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那時...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.10,0:13:14.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到鏡中 的確是她
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.61,0:13:18.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鏡子還有監視攝影機
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.74,0:13:20.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來事情是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.67,0:13:25.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,認知會出現偏差的 僅限於用肉眼看的人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.27,0:13:31.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這眉毛的仇 我非報不可啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.66,0:13:32.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開工了 初春
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.13,0:13:34.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.74,0:13:49.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像好厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.56,0:13:53.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不這樣做的話 靠這裡的終端處理速度會跟不上
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.18,0:13:59.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有 學舍之園並不是177支部的轄區
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.27,0:14:00.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們這樣做沒問題嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.13,0:14:03.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上級已經允許了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.50,0:14:06.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 初春 儘管給我上
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.12,0:14:08.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是是 咚～
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.78,0:14:17.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裝在學舍之園的監視攝影機總共有2458台
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.93,0:14:19.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經全部連接上了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.77,0:14:22.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給我等著 瀏海女
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.49,0:14:26.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要把你挖出來
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.35,0:14:29.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請你不要忘了我們說好的蛋糕哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.34,0:14:31.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,管你要三塊還是四塊 你愛吃多少就多少
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.12,0:14:32.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萬歲～
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.50,0:14:34.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太多了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.85,0:14:35.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.39,0:14:37.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒問題的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.02,0:14:40.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說的不是蛋糕啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.12,0:14:45.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初春 從地區E到H 還有J和N就不管了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.85,0:14:46.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.03,0:14:52.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那幾塊地區離常盤台是最遠的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.47,0:14:55.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我們的學生基本上是不會去的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.00,0:14:59.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那 人流量大的地方也往後推吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.76,0:15:01.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.25,0:15:03.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,犯人的服裝
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.31,0:15:07.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在學舍之園裡面 不是很搶眼嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.88,0:15:09.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,的確是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.13,0:15:13.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是說她在人多的地方一直用著能力？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.88,0:15:14.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概是了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.02,0:15:18.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 能力是不可能永遠用下去的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.52,0:15:22.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是說她會找些沒人的地方喘口氣？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.86,0:15:24.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說對了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.21,0:15:26.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼一來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.07,0:15:49.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找～到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.19,0:15:56.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了我那可愛的眉毛 我要報仇報個痛快
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.01,0:16:00.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.72,0:16:03.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在不是佩服她的時候 請你去追啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.85,0:16:04.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 對啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.35,0:16:09.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.51,0:16:11.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.46,0:16:13.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才好像被什麼東西撞到了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.15,0:16:15.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.63,0:16:17.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.36,0:16:26.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在這附近
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.47,0:16:33.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是風紀委員
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.18,0:16:36.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請你乖乖束手就擒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.30,0:16:41.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唉 怎麼可能乖乖就範呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.15,0:16:44.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初春 麻煩你導航了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.72,0:16:45.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是是～
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.50,0:16:49.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出了巷子以後左轉 請跑進三號街
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.67,0:16:50.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收到
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.63,0:16:51.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初春
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.38,0:16:51.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是～
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.38,0:16:55.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.33,0:17:01.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼 為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.11,0:17:32.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,捉迷藏 到此為止了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.94,0:17:34.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.34,0:17:37.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼Dummy Check沒用
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.01,0:17:39.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天曉得呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.93,0:17:44.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正因為這樣 常盤台的人才可恨
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.50,0:18:01.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真可惜 這玩意對我沒用的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.90,0:18:04.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.56,0:18:14.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已經手下留情了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.30,0:18:15.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初春
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.38,0:18:20.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請跟警備員聯絡 說嫌疑犯已經抓到了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.57,0:18:21.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是～
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.17,0:18:22.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦你了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.93,0:18:29.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.09,0:18:39.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要幫她畫條什麼樣的眉毛呢...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.50,0:18:44.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.76,0:18:48.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很搞笑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.48,0:18:50.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 那個...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.42,0:18:55.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笑啊 要笑儘管笑啊 就像那個人一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.41,0:18:57.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個人？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.31,0:19:06.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,春天 我在明媚的陽光下假寐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.93,0:19:12.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我天真地認為幸福的時光會一直持續下去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.31,0:19:13.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.13,0:19:22.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,春天結束了 結束得相當突然
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.57,0:19:26.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼？ 常盤台的大小姐就那麼好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.29,0:19:28.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,並不是那樣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.80,0:19:29.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是為什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.25,0:19:32.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為你的眉毛...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.19,0:19:34.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.14,0:19:42.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我恨那個拋棄我的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.98,0:19:46.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我恨那個搶走我男朋友的常盤台女生
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.41,0:19:48.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我最最恨的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.67,0:19:51.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是這世上所有的眉毛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.32,0:19:56.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 才想讓大家的眉毛都變得搞笑
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.24,0:19:57.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.52,0:20:00.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 從中間開始我就聽不懂你說什麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.84,0:20:02.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.50,0:20:04.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼啦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.65,0:20:05.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來啊 笑我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.11,0:20:08.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃 那個...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.69,0:20:12.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不奇怪哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.30,0:20:20.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這點嘛...那個...對 這剛好是個萌點
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.30,0:20:22.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我挺喜歡這點的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.61,0:20:30.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罪孽深重的女人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.42,0:20:48.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請問...我可以寫信給你嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.65,0:20:51.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.04,0:21:09.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她很完美地隱藏了自己的身影啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.10,0:21:14.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話說她不是只是Level 2嗎 這就怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.41,0:21:18.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道資料出錯了？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.77,0:21:20.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎...怎麼可能
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.51,0:21:28.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是怎麼回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.86,0:21:31.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃 其他的受害者也是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.15,0:21:37.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像那是第十學區的大學開發的特殊墨水
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.76,0:21:40.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽說一星期內絕對消失不了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.77,0:21:46.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐天 要不要再幫你準備頂帽子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.23,0:21:50.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個死粗眉女
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.24,0:21:53.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早知道當時就在她臉上亂畫一通了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.69,0:21:55.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 佐天 你冷靜點
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.56,0:21:59.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我該怎麼辦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.53,0:23:31.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 初春
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.42,0:23:32.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道什麼是竹皮屐婆婆嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.50,0:23:40.00,title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\1c&H4D81DF\bord2}#4 都市傳說
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.68,0:23:33.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竹皮屐婆婆？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.81,0:23:36.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽說有個穿著竹皮屐的老婆婆 會以時速100km追過來
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.59,0:23:37.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好恐怖！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.06,0:23:38.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且還是裸跑
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.03,0:23:38.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好噁心！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.79,0:01:18.66,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}放飛深刻於心靈中的夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.68,0:01:22.45,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(20,50)}即使捨去未來也在所不惜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.56,0:01:25.45,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}極限什麼的不去管它  因為毫無意義
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.47,0:01:34.46,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}以此力綻放遙遠彼方的思念
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.61,0:01:43.12,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}走過的這條路  如果只能回頭四顧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.28,0:01:49.86,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}何不在此讓一切灰飛煙滅
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.96,0:01:53.15,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}墜入黑暗的街道中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.21,0:01:56.54,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}人們能夠堅持到何時
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.66,0:01:59.79,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}定能在這加速的疼痛中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.85,0:02:04.09,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}將重要的人守護
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.40,0:02:07.35,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}看吧  在這閃電充斥的星球上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.42,0:02:11.12,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}如今只有我的電磁炮能脫穎而出
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.19,0:02:17.82,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}抓住身體內以光速交織著的  切實的預感
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.91,0:02:24.54,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}只要自身所望  則不遺餘力地綻放光輝
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.58,0:02:27.50,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}堅信著昔日的誓言
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.52,0:02:36.57,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}在眼中閃爍的淚光  也會化做自身的堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.01,0:22:16.30,edcn,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.30,0:22:23.15,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}話還遠遠沒有說夠
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.70,0:22:30.54,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}晚霞已染紅了街道
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.06,0:22:37.97,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}世事難都如人願
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.54,0:22:45.63,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}察覺時已相依哭泣
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.96,0:22:49.68,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}戀情  夢想  鮮花  彩虹  微風
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.70,0:22:52.22,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}抓緊這一切
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.34,0:22:55.98,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}沒事的  打起精神來
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.04,0:23:00.33,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}因為有我在你的身邊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.45,0:23:07.12,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}與其悔恨今日不如放眼明天
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.20,0:23:10.84,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}沒事的  不要迷惘
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.88,0:23:16.92,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}向著未知的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.94,0:23:21.97,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}永遠走下去
